      "kind": "faq",
      "heading": "Questions",
      "html": "<h3>What goes in a monthly care home compliance checklist?</h3><p>Health and safety and the environment (falls, hoists under LOLER, fire, legionella), infection control, safeguarding, training and supervision, care plans, medication, and a mock inspection.</p><h3>Is a monthly audit a legal requirement?</h3><p>There is no single legal monthly format. Your own policies and risk assessments set how often. Regulators expect you to show checks are done.</p><h3>Does the checklist change by UK nation?</h3><p>The safety checks are much the same. The framework differs. CQC covers England, the Care Inspectorate covers Scotland, Care Inspectorate Wales covers Wales and RQIA covers Northern Ireland.</p><h3>Can I run the round on WhatsApp?</h3><p>Yes. You get each prompt in WhatsApp and reply by text, voice note or photo. No app to install.</p><h3>Related guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/care-home-audit-software-uk.html\">Care home audit software</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/cqc-compliance-audit-checklist-uk.html\">CQC compliance audit checklist</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/safeguarding-audit-care-home-uk.html\">Safeguarding audit for care homes</a></li></ul>"
